title: DNS TXT Record C2 Tunneling
id: c1ab5367-1f4a-4390-a945-eee4d5a7d50e
status: experimental
description: Detects DNS TXT-based C2 tunneling.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1071/004/
logsource:
  category: dns
detection:
  selection:
    QueryType:
      - 'TXT'
      - 'NULL'
      - 'CNAME'
    query|re: '([A-Za-z0-9+/=]{50,})\.'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - query
  - QueryType
  - src_ip
falsepositives:
  - Some security and antivirus products use long TXT lookups
level: high
tags:
  - attack.command_and_control
  - attack.t1071.004
